set_option linter.unusedVariables false

/-!
# A097608

Triangle read by rows: number of Dyck paths of semilength n and having abscissa of the leftmost valley equal to k (if no valley, then it is taken to be 2n; 2<=k<=2n).

The 81 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A097608

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 1, 0, 1, 2, 1, 1, 0, 1, 5,
    3, 3, 1, 1, 0, 1, 14, 9, 9, 4,
    3, 1, 1, 0, 1, 42, 28, 28, 14, 10,
